# MeuFlux Architecture Rules

## Business Logic Location
- Pure client calculations → `src/utils/` (no React, no fetch, no side effects)
- Server logic → `server/services/` (Gemini, Pluggy, cache, Telegram)
- Edge Functions → `supabase/functions/pluggy-proxy/` (BFF, webhooks)
- iOS domain → `ios/Packages/MeuFluxDomain/` (pure Swift, no UIKit/SwiftUI)

## Critical: No Logic in Components
- React components NEVER compute financial totals
- Components call `src/utils/*.js` functions with the data they already have
- Zustand stores are thin wrappers: fetch → store → serve to components

## Parity Rule (Highest Priority)
- `src/utils/creditBillPeriod.js` and `supabase/functions/pluggy-proxy/creditBillPeriod.ts` MUST be functionally identical
- Any change to one must be applied to the other in the same commit
- Verify: `npm run test:fixtures`
- Same applies to `creditConnectors/profiles.js` ↔ `creditConnectors/profiles.ts`

## AI Services
- All Gemini API calls go through `server/services/geminiService.js` (server) or `supabase/functions/pluggy-proxy/index.ts` (edge)
- Never call Gemini directly from React components
- iOS: use `ios/Packages/MeuFluxIntelligence/` with Foundation Models + Gemini fallback

## Pluggy Integration
- All Pluggy API calls go through `server/services/pluggyClient.js`
- Never call Pluggy directly from the frontend
- Webhook handlers in `server/routes/webhooks.js` and `supabase/functions/pluggy-webhook/`

## Credit Connectors
- See `docs/connectors/README.md` and individual bank guides before changing any billing logic
- Never use `account.balance` as open-bill total when it equals `creditLimit − availableCreditLimit`
- Index by due month, not calendar purchase month
- Deduplicate installment projections against real PENDING/POSTED with same N/M

## iOS Rules
- `MeuFluxDomain` package: zero imports outside Foundation (pure Swift)
- Always use `Decimal` for money values, never `Double`
- Apple Intelligence: always check `LanguageModel.isAvailable`, always have Gemini fallback
- Run `swift test` before marking any iOS change as done

## Naming (from CONTEXT.md)
- Billing cycle → **fatura** (not invoice, bill)
- Open cycle → **ciclo aberto** (not open bill, current period)  
- Connector profile → **conector** (not bank adapter)
- Financial dashboard → **Momento Financeiro** (not overview, dashboard)
- Manual expense → **transação manual** (not custom transaction)
